# `import_config "#{config_env()}.exs"` does not ABORT a prod config load on the missing file.
# This sabotage removes the base emission tuple, so a generated app has no prod.exs again — a
# `Config.Reader.read!(env: :prod)` / a MIX_ENV=prod release would abort on the missing import.
# The named §2.1 red path (config/prod.exs must be emitted for every set) MUST flip.
